      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} I am more than happy to clarify. The group banner is too narrow to fit the existing group banner designs. banners were designed to a size requirement for the old UI that the new UI needs to support. even if we re-design our banners they're really too narrow to view or make look good. \n\ntext for nameplate pronoun section is too small to read especially when nameplates are at smaller scales. there's plenty of room to make the relative size of that text larger. \n\nThe quest symbol is way too small\n\nAn age verified symbol on the nameplate really should be there. \n\na toggle in settings to revert the UI or at least the nameplates to legacy format should be added.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
